BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Language: Cpp
Standard: c++17
ColumnLimit: 80
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
PointerAlignment: Left
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Never
